{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Which you have not known.</b> From which no sign has come, even concerning their very existence. For those known through sense perception or through a sign, it is known of them that they always act in one uniform manner, so that it is known they act by natural necessity, not by volition — and therefore it is of no avail to pray to them or to serve them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:21:19.037738186Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}